__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
result
result-*

# vendor/ is its own git repository (vendor/README.md), not a submodule:
# ~659 MB of imperatively installed third-party payload that the flake never
# evaluates. Ignored outright so it cannot be swept into this repo's history
# by a stray `git add -A`, where it would be permanent and paid by every
# clone. A clone of this repo does not bring it; patch-zcode.sh rebuilds it.
/vendor/

# OS2 (2026-09-22-tvix-aios-step1): cargo's build output, and the fork link a
# hand `cargo` session needs (`nix build .#tvix-aios-src -o tvix`). The flake
# provides ./tvix in every build itself, so neither is ever tracked.
/target/
/tvix
